  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing the Quality, Utility, and Access to Low-cost (EQUAL) Compute Network</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDRC launched Enhancing the Quality, Utility, and Access to Low-cost (EQUAL) Compute Network as part of the larger AI4D program, with funding from the Government of Canada and FCDO, and additional support from the Gates Foundation, to meet those challenges. Through the AI4D program, the EQUAL Compute Network will support greater access to critical resources such as graphic processing units, data centres and cloud computing for the development of responsible AI. The EQUAL Compute Network will also support research and evidence generation related to sustainable compute infrastructure models and innovations in the Global South.</narrative>
  </description>
